        <body>
            <div xml:id="d506">

                <pb facs="0550" n="384" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg384"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.00/1226</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gonzales to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-15T00:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 15, 1917, midnight</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President Menocal received from two representatives of Government in Santiago
                    following cablegram tonight: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Interpreting your wishes and policy we today visited Mayor Comacho,
                            liberal, who had taken refuge in Italian Consulate, assured him in your
                            name he will be absolutely unmolested and respected in position as
                            mayor. We asked him make our attitude plain to all liberals here,
                            stating your Government opposed to all reprisals, and only desire prompt
                            complete restoration public peace and tranquillity.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>The President cabled reply as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>I applaud your conduct with respect to Mayor Comacho. Continue to employ
                            these methods.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
